      "content": "When everything feels broken, trying to \"fix\" it all at once is impossible, and that heavy pressure is what is exhausting you. Instead of trying to climb over the wall, perhaps we can look for a small crack in it to just rest against for a moment. A truly broken system needs pausing, not more force, so let's focus only on finding one space where you can give yourself permission to simply stop trying for a few minutes. You are not a mistake; you are someone carrying immense pressure.",
